+Evaluate the raw managed DeFoG generation directly from its generation
+directory:
+
+```bash
+DEFOG_GENERATION_DIR=outputs/baselines/defog/community_small/seed_42/generations/seed_42_n_1024
+
+PYTHONPATH=src python scripts/evaluate_graph_generation_report.py \
+  --config configs/experiments/grapher/community_small_defog_corrector.yaml \
+  --generated-dir "$DEFOG_GENERATION_DIR" \
+  --output-dir "$DEFOG_GENERATION_DIR/evaluation_report"
+```
+
+The evaluator reads `manifest.json`, discovers `base_graphs.pkl`, labels the
+metric row `defog_to_test`, and avoids adding a duplicate source row for the
+same file. Use `--generated-stage defog_800k` when checkpoint-specific labels
+are needed.
